        }
      ],
      "en": "Aren’t all the acts of his power and of his might, and the full account of the greatness of Mordecai, to which the king advanced him, written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Media and Persia?",
      "ko": "왕의 능력의 모든 행적과 모르드개를 높여 존귀케 한 사적이 메대와 바사 열왕의 일기에 기록되지 아니하였느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "cf5df8cf628bd24b196e5f99fdd53158f1c0359b4101f0315ba957bc7d454dc0",
      "translation_text_hash": "674f301441a1f2596de39618cd2b2d300ca7cd26458666c71add8a5baa236b21",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
